SUMMARY:Member Meet Up: Sunset Kayak
LOCATION:Offsite: Paddle Boston
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are Confirmed\
 nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188062\n\nJoin fellow 
 members for a relaxing sunset kayak along the scenic Charles River. Enjoy 
 the great outdoors\, while connecting with fellow members\, and taking in 
 stunning views of the Boston skyline from a fresh vantage. Hosted by The '
 Quin Membership Team\, please look forward to gathering on land at 5:00PM 
 at Paddle Boston for a casual mingle\, outfitting\, and a brief orientatio
 n before getting on the water at 5:30PM. Kayaks will be provided\, and all
  experience levels are welcome.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserv
 ed for member only. All attendees will be required to sign a waiver prior 
 to kayaking. This event is weather permitting\; a rain date will be offere
 d if necessary.
